{
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.angelic_wings.description": "I Believe I Can Fly",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.angelic_wings.enchant.text": "在吸收使魔后，翼翅会相应获得如下魔咒（在这之前可正常附魔）：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)铁匠[#]()：耐久\u00A0X\n\n+ [#](5555FF)龙[#]()：经验修补\n\n+ [#](5555FF)守护者[#]()：保护，\n魔咒等级由使魔的肢体数决定\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.angelic_wings.name": "天使翼翅",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.angelic_wings.spotlight.text": "这对翼翅是一件[#](AA00AA)天辉[#]()奇迹盔甲，也兼作鞘翅。\\\n这件物品的真正力量，在于能吸收[#](5555FF)火翼[#]()使魔以获取其力量，给予你[#](AA00AA)创造飞行[#]()能力。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.alt_essence.text": "[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:corrupted_essence)可通过击杀具有[#](AA00AA)灵魂禁锢[#]()效果的天辉魔灵获取。效果的施加需用到[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:ethereal_rope)，还要配以绕过绳索所提供抗性的方法。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.celestial.text": "**掉落物**：[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:celestial_essence)",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.celestial.title": "天辉魔灵",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.description": "未受缚的天辉魔灵",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.essence.text": "[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:celestial_essence)是获得难以想象之力量的必须物质；掌控强大的魔灵、获取神奇的物品，都须依靠它。要获得这一灵髓，需要在本位面中不加束缚地召唤一只[#](AA00AA)天辉魔灵[#]()，然后杀掉它。注意，这并不是简单的任务，因为一只未受缚的魔灵能为周围带来极大危险。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.celestial_essence.name": "天辉灵髓",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.description": "遵命，大人！",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.enchant.text": "在吸收使魔后，王冠会相应获得如下魔咒（在这之前可正常附魔）：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)铁匠[#]()：耐久\u00A0X\n\n+ [#](5555FF)龙[#]()：经验修补\n\n+ [#](5555FF)守护者[#]()：保护，\n魔咒等级由使魔的肢体数决定\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.name": "恶魔王冠",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.partner.text": "此外，你还可将[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:demonic_crown)赠与[#](AA00AA)恶魔配偶[#]()，增强它们的战斗能力，让它们能真正助你战斗。\\\n王冠还能增强伴侣的药水延时能力，且能同时增加效果的等级。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.spotlight.text": "这顶王冠是一件[#](AA00AA)魔王[#]()奇迹盔甲，初铸成时能让许多怪物不再攻击你，还可让[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:venti_sandals)无限跳跃。\\\n这件物品的真正力量，在于能吸收[#](AA00AA)使魔[#]()以获取它们的力量。详见后页。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.upgrade.text": "在吸收使魔后佩戴王冠，即可相应获得如下增益：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)恶魔[#]()：获得抗火。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)克苏鲁[#]()：获得水下呼吸，\n水生生物不再攻击你，王冠也会获得水下速掘魔咒。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)蝙蝠[#]()：获得夜视。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.demonic_crown.upgrade2.text": "+ [#](5555FF)升级无头鼠骑士[#]()：末影人\n不再攻击你。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)监守者升级眼魔[#]()（需有\n前述所有四种升级）：监守者不再攻击你，免疫失明和黑暗效果。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.description": "银河之途",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.galactical.text": "**掉落物**：无，[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:galactic_essence)的获取见[灵髓访问器](entry://extra_spirits/essence_accessor)",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.galactical.title": "银河魔灵",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.heart_recipe.text": "等会，这怎么不是个仪式？？\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.name": "黑洞",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.spotlight_heart.text": "终于，你找到了驯服[#](AA00AA)银河魔灵[#]()的方法。向它们呈上[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:primordial_heart)，你即会获得它们的永恒感激。\\\n但尽管如此，它们依然极为强大，会决定自己的职业。（它们是碎矿者，熔炼者，还是铸晶者不由你决定。）\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.ending.spotlight_primordial.text": "和你先前收集的灵髓不同，[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:primordial_essence)由[#](AA00AA)诡奇魔灵[#]()铸造而来，以所有其他灵髓为原料，并以逆熵融合。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.essence_accessor.description": "打开通向魔灵体内灵髓的门",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.essence_accessor.name": "灵髓访问器",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.essence_accessor.spotlight_scrap.text": "这件物品是种极为强大的装置，能访问和提取魔灵体内的灵髓，同时造成伤害。直接用它右击魔灵即可。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.description": "并不是不死鸟",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.description.text": "**升级效果**\\\n将多段跳、跳跃提升、缓降换为鞘翅飞行和摔落伤害免疫。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.description.title": "变成飞机",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.fire_bird.text": "**提供**：[#](AA00AA)更强的具翼增益[#]()、[#](AA00AA)免疫飘浮[#]()",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.fire_bird.title": "火翼",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.fire_bird.name": "火翼",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.infused_belt.description": "用来挂我的挎包的工具腰带",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.infused_belt.enchant.text": "在吸收使魔后，腰带会相应获得如下魔咒（在这之前可正常附魔）：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)铁匠[#]()：耐久\u00A0X\n\n+ [#](5555FF)龙[#]()：经验修补\n\n+ [#](5555FF)守护者[#]()：保护，\n魔咒等级由使魔的肢体数决定\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.infused_belt.name": "灌注腰带",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.infused_belt.spotlight.text": "这件腰带是一件[#](AA00AA)巨灵[#]()奇迹盔甲，组合了[](item://occultism:satchel)和[](item://occultism:ender_satchel)的功能，制造需使用绑定至玩家的末影挎包。\\\n \\\n右击可打开挎包，Shift右击可打开你的末影箱。\\\n两者的键位依然有效。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.infused_belt.upgrade.text": "在吸收使魔后佩戴腰带，即可相应获得如下增益：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)河狸[#]()：获得急迫。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)莎布·尼古拉斯[#]()：\n获得抗性提升。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)升级妖精[#]()：\n获得生命恢复。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)长到最大的奇美拉[#]()：\n获得力量。\n\n穿戴其他奇迹盔甲时效果会变得更强。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.name": "神秘学：额外魔灵",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.overview.description": "附赠额外魔灵",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.overview.info.text": "欢迎来到[#](AA00AA)神秘学：额外魔灵[#]()，“最官方”的神秘学附属（因为作者是最大的贡献者）！本附属聚焦于扩展[#](AA00AA)诡奇魔灵[#]()，但也并未局限于此。模组添加了我感觉不太符合神秘学本体，但最后可能加入其中的物品和机制。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.overview.name": "深奥神秘学",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.overview.note.text": "此版本只是公开测试，新内容只会加入Minecraft\u00A026.1+版本。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.overview.note.title": "注意事项",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.unbreakable.description": "移除耐久度",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.unbreakable.name": "基岩化物品",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.unbreakable.spotlight_cluster.text": "亲手制作、端详并最终握持此物时，你将在神秘学旅程中第一次感受到与[#](AA00AA)天辉[#]()之力的短暂共鸣，或许，奇迹就会由此发生。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.unbreakable.spotlight_scrap.text": "在诡奇采矿中，偶尔能发现一些[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:bedrock_scrap)。借助远古仪式，强大的魔灵可将宝石镶嵌其中，铸造出[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:bedrock_gem_cluster)。这件传奇物品能将普通装备变得坚不可摧。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.venti_sandals.description": "风力驱动",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.venti_sandals.enchant.text": "在吸收使魔后，凉鞋会相应获得如下魔咒（在这之前可正常附魔）：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)铁匠[#]()：耐久\u00A0X\n\n+ [#](5555FF)龙[#]()：经验修补\n\n+ [#](5555FF)守护者[#]()：保护，\n魔咒等级由使魔的肢体数决定\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.venti_sandals.name": "流风凉鞋",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.venti_sandals.spotlight.text": "这双凉鞋是一件[#](AA00AA)火灵[#]()奇迹盔甲，初铸成时只会抵消摔落伤害，避免踩坏耕地，有多段跳效果时会让其在[](item://minecraft:elytra)飞行时也能生效。\\\n这件物品的真正力量，在于能吸收[#](AA00AA)使魔[#]()以获取它们的力量。详见后页。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.venti_sandals.upgrade.text": "在吸收**升级**使魔后穿戴凉鞋，即可相应获得如下增益：\n\n+ [#](5555FF)具翼[#]()：获得大量\n跳跃段数（佩戴[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:demonic_crown)可无限跳跃）。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)鹿[#]()：加快速度，\n获得步伐辅助。\n\n+ [#](5555FF)木乃伊[#]()：有30%%概率\n闪避攻击（佩戴[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:demonic_crown)时再+10%%）。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.description": "我真心许愿……",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.name": "许愿神灯",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.spotlight.text": "这盏神灯是[#](AA00AA)天辉魔灵[#]()的监牢，禁锢在其中的强大魔灵将会实现愿望。\n充能时，应对将近死亡的天辉魔灵使用神灯，这之后你就可对它许愿。\n主手持神灯，副手持代表你愿望的物品。愿望实现后的产物见后页。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_book.text": "可用于驯服[#](AA00AA)天辉魔灵[#]()，这本书能带来工作速度极快的工人。终于。\\\n主手持它，副手持[](item://occultism:trinity_gem)，再对生命值低于30%%的[#](AA00AA)未受缚的天辉魔灵[#]()同时使用。\\\n注意，如此操作只会消耗宝石，不过魔灵死后会变成[](item://occultism:fragile_soul_gem)。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_control.text": "以[#](AA00AA)灵魂禁锢[#]()效果束缚生物，让其瘫痪数秒；不过它也会给予目标以极强的防御力。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_kill.text": "这把刀是[](item://occultism:butcher_knife)的特殊版本。除去更强力之外，由恶魔领主（佩戴具备所有增益的[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:demonic_crown)）使用时，它还能一击击倒所有敌人，但也同时会对使用者本人造成伤害。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_rich.text": "击中敌人时可获得金粒，击杀时则能获得特殊物品；也能增强龙之贪婪效果。\\\n能吸收经过**铁匠升级**的[#](5555FF)贪婪使魔[#]()和[#](5555FF)龙使魔[#]()。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_shield.text": "对魔灵使用此物品可吸收它们的力量。充能后佩戴，即可防御伤害。累积防御[#](FFAA00)一百万[#]()点伤害后，还能获得[](item://occultism_extra_spirits:forbidden_butcher_knife)的特殊效果。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.extra_spirits.wish_lamp.wish_travel.text": "使用该指南针可为它设置目的地，不限维度，不限位置。与[](item://occultism:entity_wormhole)配合使用，它就成了迅速前往任意位置的最好方法。\n",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.name": "魔灵百科",
  "book.occultism_extra_spirits.encyclopedia_of_spirits.tooltip": "魔灵全典，第二卷",
